					"content": "无论怎么想，都是不可思议的事呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420504,
					"content": "这些都归功于真的力量。对于永恒，她的理解比我更深。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420505,
					"content": "「永恒」是与时间息息相关的概念。一旦触及永恒，时间的概念就会变得模糊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420506,
					"content": "进入空间时我看到了奇妙的景象。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120420507,
					"content": "时间既在前进，又在后退。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420508
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120420508,
					"content": "时间本身不具有意义，也无法以常理诠释…原来，这就是我感受到的「湍流」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420509,
					"content": "或许，这正是你们能顺利返回这个时间节点的原因。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420510,
					"content": "不过，那种紊乱感已经完全消失了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420511,
					"content": "我还不能完全理解。但直觉告诉我，一切的根源…就是那颗种子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420512,
					"content": "我倒觉得，只靠真的力量，或许…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420513,
					"content": "我明白你在想什么。或许真有「更高层{RUBY#[D]伊斯塔露}次的力量」参与其中。但无论如何，她的这个办法在最后关头保护了我们所有人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420514,
					"content": "要是没有神樱树，稻妻可能早在几百年前就被灾难与污秽完全吞没了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420515,
					"content": "我知道你对神樱树有奇妙的感知，可对我来说，神樱树一直都存在。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420516,
					"content": "以前你还想向我证明这棵神樱树与真的意识空间存在关联，可惜没能成功，对吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420517,
					"content": "嗯，现在我明白了。因为那个时候神樱树甚至都还没有被种下去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420518,
					"content": "可是，你们不觉得那棵树跟现在这副样子差别很大吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420519,
					"content": "神樱树可是种在我的地盘里，当然要根据我的趣味进行修剪啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420520,
					"content": "呃…你好霸道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420521,
					"content": "开玩笑的。发芽至今，这棵树也经历了很多。多亏狐狸的悉心照料，它才能有如今这副模样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420522,
					"content": "和我也不是完全无关的哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420523,
					"content": "你们离开又再次进入空间，按理说间隔很短，可内部的恶战已经持续了几百年，没错吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420524,
					"content": "如果我没猜错…旅行者，你一定像我说的，一直默念着心中的愿望吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420525,
						120420526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420525,
					"content": "当然了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420527
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120420527,
					"content": "那时我感知到影的所在地，也同样察觉到内部的「时间」有异常。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420528,
					"content": "如果「时间」也是我们追寻所求之物的要素之一，那只知道「位置」是不够的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420529,
					"content": "不过幸好，凭借你们顽强的意志，湍流带你们去到的，正是一切心愿汇聚的时间交点——最具有可能性的那个瞬间。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420530,
					"content": "湍流的走向或许受到了真的影响，但能帮到影，每个人的努力都不可或缺。这一次确实要谢谢你们呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420531,
					"content": "难道说，我们碰上那场决战不是偶然，而是我们一定会遇到、见证的场面…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420532,
						120420533
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420532,
					"content": "或许这也是将军说的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420534
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120420534,
					"content": "我本以为，空间内外的时间流动一致，所以旅行者再度出现，令我非常震惊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420535
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420535,
					"content": "那一刻我首先想到，「莫非稻妻遭遇了巨大的灾难？」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420536
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420536,
					"content": "结果原来是你想要救我…你们为我而来，帮助我迎来了最好的结局。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420537
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420537,
					"content": "多谢二位。你们为我做了许多，我铭记在心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420538
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420538,
					"content": "影，你现在感觉如何？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420539
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420539,
					"content": "身体完全恢复了，将军的意志不再和我对抗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420540
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420540,
					"content": "身体当然很重要啦，但我更想知道，你的心情平复了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420541
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420541,
					"content": "你见到真的意识了，对吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420542
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420542,
					"content": "只是听到了她的声音，不算是见到…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420543
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420543,
					"content": "没关系，有点怀念而已。我已经决定向前了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420544
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420544,
					"content": "但这一次又让我坚信，真确实很厉害，她在那时就预料到了稻妻未来的种种可能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420545
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420545,
					"content": "甚至，连我的这份不成熟，都被她计算在内。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420546
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420546,
					"content": "稻妻能迎来今天，也是她的功劳吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420547,
						120420548
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420547,
					"content": "真很厉害。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420549
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120420549,
					"content": "我只是种了一颗种子而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420550
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420550,
					"content": "你和她的意志，缺一不可。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420551
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120420551,
					"content": "对啊！你是凭自己的本事回到她面前的，很厉害了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420552,
						120420553
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420552,
					"content": "最后的行为看似简单。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420554,
						120420555
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120420554,
					"content": "不能因为因果倒转…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420556
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120420556,
					"content": "#…谢谢你，{NICKNAME}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420557
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420557,
					"content": "直到今天，你和稻妻才真正从几百年前的阴影中完全走出来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420558
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420558,
					"content": "真和你，是稻妻不可或缺的「过去」与「未来」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420559
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420559,
					"content": "难得从你这里听到安慰的话，我也收下了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420560
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420560,
					"content": "哎呀，那不还是因为以前的你根本听不进去嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420561
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420561,
					"content": "和真说了一样的话呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420562
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420562,
					"content": "真的吗？那将军的位置，是不是也可以给我坐两天呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420563
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420563,
					"content": "算了算了，这种麻烦事我才不要。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420564
					],
					"speakerTitle": "八重神子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420564,
					"content": "玩笑就到此为止。接下来，我还有很多事要做。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420565
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420565,
					"content": "我会和将军一起仔细审视如今的稻妻，整理现状，斟酌未来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420566
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420566,
					"content": "随后…我将下令解除锁国。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420567
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420567,
					"content": "真的吗？这是不得了的大事呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420568
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420568,
					"content": "我已决定不再追逐静止的「永恒」。既然如此，没必要再封锁这个国度。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420569
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420569,
					"content": "接下来，稻妻一定会面临更多挑战…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420570
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420570,
					"content": "也会诞生出更多「相遇」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420571
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120420571,
					"content": "我对此充满期待。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "雷电将军"
				},
				{
					"id": 120420555,
					"content": "就妄自菲薄。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420556
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120420553,
					"content": "却是由无数努力积淀而成。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420554,
						120420555
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120420548,
					"content": "但影也做了重要的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420549
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120420533,
					"content": "命运的必然吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420534
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120420526,
					"content": "难道这有特殊的含义？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120420527
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}